[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4215930431","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118243#issuecomment-4215930431","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118243","id":4215930431,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77Sf4_","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T16:44:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T16:44:06Z","body":"`set_width()` and `set_height()` shouldn't be exposed in the first place. We need to remove them before we go into beta. \r\n\r\nThe problem with them is that you will create and recreate the texture multiple times if you use them. It's especially bad if the user doesn't call setup. For example, it encourages the following pattern:\r\n\r\n```\r\nvar dt = DrawableTexture.new()\r\ndt.set_width(x) # initializes the texture with default settings and width of x\r\ndt.set_height(y) # deletes the texture, creates a new texture with default settings and size (x, y)\r\n```\r\n\r\nEven worse, this could happen each frame and then you end up destroying performance. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4215930431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4216336325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118243#issuecomment-4216336325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118243","id":4216336325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77UC_F","user":{"login":"vbettaque","id":6683337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2ODMzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6683337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque","html_url":"https://github.com/vbettaque","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vbettaque/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T17:53:58Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T17:53:58Z","body":"Ahh, I see. Personally, I used the methods exclusively for in-editor prototyping using tool scripts, not in-game stuff. But if they are meant to be removed anyway, then this fix is not necessary.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4216336325/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"ey